msgid "Rufus update policy"
msgstr "Polisa azuriranja Rufus-a"

#. • MSG_005
msgid "Do you want to allow Rufus to check for application updates online?"
msgstr "Dozvolite Rufus-u da automatski trazi nove verzije?"

