msgid "Windows XP cannot access drives that use the GPT partition scheme.\n\nRufus can still create this drive for use on another computer. Continue only if you are creating EFI-bootable media and the target computer supports UEFI.\n\nDo you want to continue?"
msgstr "Windows XP ne moze da pristupi uredajima koji koriste GPT particionu semu.\n\nRufus ipak moze da napravi ovaj uredaj za koriscenje na drugom racunaru. Nastavite samo ako pravite EFI pokretacki medijum i ciljni racunar podrzava UEFI.\n\nZelite li da nastavite?"

